{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KEqEagdrJrQWLTxSTgpV8v","type":"tool_result","content":"The file <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-002-RCAslj/index.html has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"47cb26f9-045c-498a-88ab-e5777735b80c","uuid":"a83d90bc-f139-4b60-a5ab-aad315613116","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:21:38.059Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-002-RCAslj/index.html","oldString":"      msg.textContent = '🎉 注册成功！激活邮件已发送至 ' + value;","newString":"      // TODO: 接入真实注册接口；目前仅为前端演示，不会提交数据\n      msg.textContent = '🎉 已收到 ' + value + '（演示页面，尚未接入注册接口）';","originalFile":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <title>团账 TeamLedger — 小团队的在线记账工具</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"团账 TeamLedger：为 5–50 人小团队打造的在线记账 SaaS，多人协作、报销审批、自动报表，一处搞定。\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"nav\">\n    <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\"><span class=\"logo-mark\">账</span>团账 TeamLedger</a>\n      <nav class=\"nav-links\">\n        <a href=\"#features\">功能</a>\n        <a href=\"#how\">上手流程</a>\n        <a href=\"#reviews\">用户评价</a>\n        <a href=\"#pricing\">价格</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n      </nav>\n      <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\">免费注册</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <!-- 首屏 -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"container hero-inner\">\n        <div class=\"hero-text\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">专为 5–50 人小团队设计</span>\n          <h1>团队的每一笔钱，<br><em>清清楚楚</em>。</h1>\n          <p class=\"lead\">团账把记账、报销、预算和报表放在一起。不用懂会计，全队一起记，老板随时看得明白。</p>\n          <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n            <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">免费注册，开始记账</a>\n            <a href=\"#features\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\">了解功能</a>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"hero-note\">14 天专业版免费试用 · 无需绑定银行卡 · 随时取消</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mock\" aria-label=\"产品界面示意\">\n          <div class=\"mock-head\">10 月账本 <span>设计工作室 · 8 位成员</span></div>\n          <div class=\"stats\">\n            <div class=\"stat\"><small>本月收入</small><b class=\"up\">¥86,400</b></div>\n            <div class=\"stat\"><small>本月支出</small><b class=\"down\">¥42,180</b></div>\n            <div class=\"stat\"><small>预算剩余</small><b>63%</b></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <i style=\"height:45%\"></i><i style=\"height:60%\"></i><i style=\"height:38%\"></i>\n            <i style=\"height:72%\"></i><i style=\"height:55%\"></i><i style=\"height:80%\"></i>\n            <i class=\"hi\" style=\"height:92%\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"tx\">\n            <li><div>客户项目尾款<div class=\"who\">林晓 · 今天 10:24</div></div><b class=\"up\">+¥18,000</b></li>\n            <li><div>办公室房租<div class=\"who\">陈默 · 昨天</div></div><b class=\"down\">−¥9,500</b></li>\n            <li><div>出差打车（待审批）<div class=\"who\">王一 · 昨天</div></div><b class=\"down\">−¥236</b></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 信任条 -->\n    <div class=\"container trust\">\n      已有 <b>12,000+</b> 个小团队在用团账记账\n      <div class=\"trust-logos\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <span>山海设计</span><span>青禾咖啡</span><span>北辰科技</span><span>拾光影像</span><span>远舟咨询</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 功能介绍 -->\n    <section id=\"features\" class=\"block\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>小团队记账需要的，都在这里</h2>\n          <p>没有复杂的会计科目，只有真正用得上的功能。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"features\">\n          <article class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">👥</div>\n            <h3>多人协作记账</h3>\n            <p>成员各自记录收支，实时同步到同一个账本。按角色分配权限，谁能看、谁能改一目了然。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">🧾</div>\n            <h3>报销与审批</h3>\n            <p>手机拍票据即可提交报销，自动识别金额与日期。负责人一键审批，进度全程可追踪。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">📊</div>\n            <h3>自动生成报表</h3>\n            <p>收支趋势、项目利润、分类占比自动汇总。月报一键导出 Excel / PDF，交给会计省心。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">🎯</div>\n            <h3>预算管控</h3>\n            <p>按部门或项目设置预算，花费接近上限时自动提醒，避免月底才发现超支。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">🏦</div>\n            <h3>银行流水导入</h3>\n            <p>支持导入主流银行与支付平台账单，智能分类、自动去重，告别手动逐笔录入。</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">🔒</div>\n            <h3>数据安全可靠</h3>\n            <p>传输与存储全程加密，每日自动备份，操作日志完整留痕，每一次修改都有据可查。</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 上手流程 -->\n    <section id=\"how\" class=\"block steps-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>三步上手，今天就能用起来</h2>\n          <p>平均 5 分钟完成配置，不需要培训。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"steps\">\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <h3>创建团队账本</h3>\n            <p>用邮箱注册，选择行业模板，常用收支分类自动生成。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <h3>邀请成员加入</h3>\n            <p>发送邀请链接，为每位成员设置记账、审批或只读权限。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <h3>随时随地记账</h3>\n            <p>网页、手机均可记录，报表实时更新，月底不再手忙脚乱。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 用户评价 -->\n    <section id=\"reviews\" class=\"block\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>听听他们怎么说</h2>\n          <p>来自设计、餐饮、科技、咨询等行业的小团队。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"reviews\">\n          <article class=\"card review\">\n            <div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 星\">★★★★★</div>\n            <blockquote>“以前报销靠微信群发截图，月底对账要花两天。用了团账以后，审批和记账一步完成，现在半小时就能出月报。”</blockquote>\n            <div class=\"author\">\n              <span class=\"avatar\">周</span>\n              <div><b>周婷</b><small>山海设计 · 合伙人</small></div>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card review\">\n            <div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 星\">★★★★★</div>\n            <blockquote>“我们有三家门店，预算功能特别实用。哪家店食材成本超了，系统会第一时间提醒，不用等到月底才发现。”</blockquote>\n            <div class=\"author\">\n              <span class=\"avatar\">刘</span>\n              <div><b>刘航</b><small>青禾咖啡 · 创始人</small></div>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card review\">\n            <div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 星\">★★★★★</div>\n            <blockquote>“权限设计很清楚，成员只能看到自己项目的账。导出的报表格式外包会计直接能用，沟通成本少了一大半。”</blockquote>\n            <div class=\"author\">\n              <span class=\"avatar\">赵</span>\n              <div><b>赵明远</b><small>北辰科技 · 运营负责人</small></div>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 价格 -->\n    <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"block\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>简单透明的价格</h2>\n          <p>按团队计费，不按人头加价。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pricing\">\n          <article class=\"card plan\">\n            <h3>免费版</h3>\n            <div class=\"price\">¥0<small> / 永久</small></div>\n            <ul>\n              <li>最多 3 位成员</li>\n              <li>1 个账本</li>\n              <li>基础收支报表</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">免费注册</a>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card plan featured\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">最受欢迎</span>\n            <h3>团队版</h3>\n            <div class=\"price\">¥99<small> / 月</small></div>\n            <ul>\n              <li>最多 20 位成员</li>\n              <li>不限账本数量</li>\n              <li>报销审批与预算提醒</li>\n              <li>银行流水导入</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">免费试用 14 天</a>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"card plan\">\n            <h3>专业版</h3>\n            <div class=\"price\">¥259<small> / 月</small></div>\n            <ul>\n              <li>最多 50 位成员</li>\n              <li>多项目利润分析</li>\n              <li>开放 API 与数据导出</li>\n              <li>专属客服支持</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a href=\"#signup\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">免费试用 14 天</a>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 注册 -->\n    <section id=\"signup\" class=\"block\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"signup\">\n          <h2>今天就让团队账目井井有条</h2>\n          <p>输入工作邮箱，30 秒创建你的团队账本。</p>\n          <form class=\"signup-form\" id=\"signupForm\" novalidate>\n            <label for=\"email\" class=\"sr-only\" hidden>工作邮箱</label>\n            <input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-lg\">免费注册</button>\n          </form>\n          <div class=\"signup-msg\" id=\"signupMsg\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n          <small>注册即表示你同意《服务条款》与《隐私政策》</small>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 常见问题 -->\n    <section id=\"faq\" class=\"block\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>常见问题</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"faq\">\n          <details>\n            <summary>我们没有专职会计，能用吗？</summary>\n            <p>完全可以。团账使用日常语言的收支分类，不需要会计知识；需要时也能一键导出给外包会计使用的标准格式。</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>试用结束后会自动扣费吗？</summary>\n            <p>不会。试用无需绑定支付方式，到期后自动降级为免费版，数据完整保留。</p>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>数据可以导出吗？</summary>\n            <p>所有版本都支持将账目导出为 Excel 或 CSV，你的数据始终属于你。</p>\n          </details>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <span>© 2026 团账 TeamLedger. 保留所有权利。</span>\n      <nav>\n        <a href=\"#features\">功能</a>\n        <a href=\"#pricing\">价格</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">帮助中心</a>\n        <a href=\"#signup\">注册</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    document.getElementById('signupForm').addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      var input = document.getElementById('email');\n      var msg = document.getElementById('signupMsg');\n      var value = input.value.trim();\n      if (!/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(value)) {\n        msg.textContent = '请输入有效的邮箱地址';\n        input.focus();\n        return;\n      }\n      msg.textContent = '🎉 注册成功！激活邮件已发送至 ' + value;\n      input.value = '';\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":278,"oldLines":7,"newStart":278,"newLines":8,"lines":["         input.focus();","         return;","       }","-      msg.textContent = '🎉 注册成功！激活邮件已发送至 ' + value;","+      // TODO: 接入真实注册接口；目前仅为前端演示，不会提交数据","+      msg.textContent = '🎉 已收到 ' + value + '（演示页面，尚未接入注册接口）';","       input.value = '';","     });","   </script>"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KEqEagdrJrQWLTxSTgpV8v","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
